Hi Guys


I have successfully Szymon Janc's patch with a shanwan controller.

What was tested:
- all buttons and axis' with jstest-gtk
- update of master and bluetooth connection
- accelerometer with jstest-gtk
- led setting
ALL SUCCESSFUL

What was not tested:
- rumble (i've no idea how to test that on DS3, if you know please let me know)

System tested on:
-Ubuntu Vivid beta 3.19 kernel
- patched version blueZ 5.30



Thanks very much to Szymon for making this work and I hope and helping
me out when I got stuck with the install.

Log files attached

Many Thanks

Laurence Brown

